      "sha256": "03f69c8bf94c6e7ab9a4369a59a41e5ac358bb3a30421b03f32cf1c022a6b53f",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Code-animation task screen. A Python editor on the left shows the program partway through its animation, with the active insertion point highlighted. A large text box on the right asks the participant to summarize the program. Playback controls and a progress bar are below the code. The study asks participants to wait until the animation finishes before entering the summary."
    },
    {
      "path": "figures/spinelli-attention-patterns-for-code-animations-px182018/figure-002-p002.png",
      "node": "274:0",
      "page": 2,
      "bbox": [
        315.9549865722656,
