        457.0530090332031
      ],
      "sha256": "6f63787bd9d22615a5bda72a7d3acf5644022579dc4a12d54e67e4010b6d5783",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Program-summary task screen after the animation. The full Python program remains in an editable editor on the left. A large response field and Submit button on the right collect a brief account of what the program does; the completed playback bar remains beneath the code."
    },
    {
      "path": "figures/spinelli-attention-patterns-for-code-animations-px182018/figure-003-p003.png",
      "node": "430:0",
      "page": 3,
      "bbox": [
